//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        Toggle Radio
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: ToggleRadio
---
<<if $hasBeenRejected == false>>
	<<show_text "QuestTitleLiepajas15">>
<<endif>>

<<if $isRadioOn == true>>
	// You turn off the radio...
	<<set $isRadioOn = false>>
<<else>>
	// You turn on the radio...
	<<set $isRadioOn = true>>
<<endif>>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        Thanks For Turn Off Radio
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: ThanksForTurningOffRadio
---

<<if $isRadioOn == false && $haveTalkedToMaple15 == false>>
	<<disable_controls "Player">>
	As you are leaving you suddenly hear a voice behind you in the distance.
	Someone: Thank You for turning it off!
	<<set $haveTalkedToMaple15 = true>>
	<<enable_controls "Player">>
<<endif>>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        Liepājas 15 BUNKER
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: Liepajas15Bunker
---
<<disable_controls "Player">>
<<set $haveTalkedToLiepajas15 = true>>

<<if $hasBeenRejected == true>>
	Voice inside: Piss Off!
<<elseif $isRadioOn == true>>
	Voice inside: Turn off the radio first! Talk after
	<<show_text "ObjectiveTurnOffRadio">>
<<else>>
	<<complete_and_hide "ObjectiveTurnOffRadio" 1>>
	You: Hello guys what do you have here?
	Voice: Ehh nothing mutch, just you know a shed...
	You: Doesn't look much like a shed, seems like this construction is well inforced?
	You: Could this be a bunker?
	Voice: Okay, yes, yes.. Now you are going to ask me if there is space inside and I can stop you and say there is.
	You: That's great, open up!
	<<show_text "ObjectiveTryToGetInLiepajas15">>
	Voice: wait, wait, wait first you need to answer a question
	Voice: what is your name?
	-> Edgars
		Voice: Oh wow Edgars what are the chances, that's my name
		Edgars: Well unfortunetly this is a no Edgar's bunker and I'm already in... so I can't let you in
		You: WTF, this is BS, you aren't going to let me in?
		You: You are going to let an innocent man die?
		Edgars: innocent... you? Whatever
		<<set $PickedName = "Edgars">>
	-> John
		Voice: Oh wow John what are the chances, that's my name
		John: Well unfortunetly this is a no John's bunker and I'm already in... so I can't let you in
		You: WTF, this is BS, you aren't going to let me in?
		You: You are going to let an innocent man die?
		John: innocent... you Sure?
		<<set $PickedName = "John">>
	-> Homer
		Voice: Oh wow Homer what are the chances, that's my name
		Homer: Well unfortunetly this is a no Homer's bunker and I'm already in... so I can't let you in
		You: WTF, this is BS, you aren't going to let me in?
		You: You are going to let an innocent man die?
		Homer: innocent... you Sure?
		<<set $PickedName = "Homer">>
	// There should be an option to pick another name that you write in.
	// And then the name appears crossed out on a poster

	This well enforced shed looks like it is going to fall apart anyways 
	
	<<complete_and_hide "ObjectiveTryToGetInLiepajas15" 2>>
	<<complete_and_hide "QuestTitleLiepajas15" 1>>
	<<complete_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerGood3" >>
	<<complete_text "ObjectiveFindBunkerOkay1" >>
	<<set $hasBeenRejected = true>>
<<endif>>
<<enable_controls "Player">>
===